# SoundPlant demo: garage, 132 BPM, Bb minor. Factory sounds only: tools/make_demos.py puts it on the emulator page.
# UK garage in Bb minor, 112 bars. A pitched vocal chop is the hook (it opens the song alone); a gliding sub plays a syncopated
# line under it, an organ skanks on the offbeats, a swung 2-step kit (kick on 1 and a skipped one, snare and clap on 2 and 4).
# The first build ends in a rewind (the throws repeat, echo and mute, a reverse sweep rises through the pause). The breakdown
# is the sub and a pad on Gbmaj7 and Ebm9. Before the last chorus an 8-bar speed-garage switch: four on the floor, a wobbling
# reese, the chop pitched up. Loop: Bbm9 | Ebm9 | Gbmaj7 | F7#9.
# T1 kit  T2 knit round sub  T3 bellows organ stab  T4 voile soprano chop  T5 knit reese  T6 knit dusty pad  T7 rayon glass bell
# T8 a second kit: shaker, conga, rim, toms and the reverse sweeps
# Song: intro 8 (the chop alone, then hats and the pad), verse 8, build 8 (the rewind), drop 16, breakdown 8, verse 8, build 8,
# speed-garage switch 8, last chorus 24, outro 16.
bpm 132
knob 9 e1 0
knob 9 e2 10
knob 9 e3 1

# ---- the sounds
# T1 the 2-step kit: a short kick, the snare pitched up and cut short, a tight clap, the hats
knob 1 d1.k1 86
knob 1 d1.k2 42
knob 1 d1.k3 76
knob 1 d1.k4 88
knob 1 d1.volume 96
knob 1 d2.k1 100
knob 1 d2.k2 26
knob 1 d2.k3 100
knob 1 d2.volume 70
knob 1 d2.send2 30
knob 1 d5.k1 112
knob 1 d5.k2 40
knob 1 d5.volume 74
knob 1 d5.send2 24
knob 1 d3.k1 102
knob 1 d3.k2 30
knob 1 d3.k4 44
knob 1 d3.volume 70
knob 1 d4.k1 102
knob 1 d4.k2 56
knob 1 d4.k4 44
knob 1 d4.volume 62
knob 1 level 94
# T2 knit round sub: mono, gliding between notes (the porta knob, the porta trick on the long slides), ducked by the kick
preset 2 round_sub knit
param 2 oct 2
knob 2 brain no
knob 2 porta 22
knob 2 ltype pump
knob 2 lspeed track_1
knob 2 lamt 38
knob 2 level 88
# T3 bellows organ stab: the skank on the offbeats, a little behind the beat
preset 3 organ_stab bellows
param 3 oct 2
knob 3 brain no
knob 3 level 98
knob 3 pan 42
knob 3 send1 24
knob 3 send2 18
# T4 voile soprano as the vocal chop: short sung syllables, the vowel moved by a lock on every note
preset 4 soprano voile
param 4 oct 2
knob 4 brain no
knob 4 vmode poly
knob 4 porta 0
knob 4 a 0
knob 4 d 66
knob 4 s 34
knob 4 r 38
knob 4 e3 108
knob 4 level 106
knob 4 pan 60
knob 4 send1 42
knob 4 send2 32
# T5 knit reese: the heavy mid bass of the speed-garage switch, a stab bass in the last chorus; its filter moved by locks
preset 5 reese knit
param 5 oct 2
knob 5 brain no
knob 5 e3 2
knob 5 ltype pump
knob 5 lspeed track_1
knob 5 lamt 40
knob 5 level 80
knob 5 pan 50
# T6 knit dusty pad: guide tones held under everything, its filter opened slowly by locks
preset 6 dusty_pad knit
param 6 oct 2
knob 6 brain no
knob 6 e3 2
knob 6 r 84
knob 6 level 70
knob 6 pan 70
knob 6 send2 46
# T7 rayon glass bell: ear candy in the echo and the hall
preset 7 glass_bell rayon
param 7 oct 2
knob 7 brain no
knob 7 level 80
knob 7 pan 92
knob 7 send1 40
knob 7 send2 56
# T8 a second kit: shaker, conga, 909 rim and toms, and the open hat with a long attack for the reverse sweeps
knob 8 engine kit
knob 8 d8.volume 58
knob 8 d8.send2 20
knob 8 d9.k1 70
knob 8 d9.volume 56
knob 8 d9.send1 14
knob 8 d6.model 23
knob 8 d6.k4 40
knob 8 d6.volume 64
knob 8 d7.model 23
knob 8 d7.k4 90
knob 8 d7.volume 62
knob 8 d10.model 24
knob 8 d10.volume 56
knob 8 d10.send2 24
knob 8 d4.model 27
knob 8 d4.k2 100
knob 8 d4.attack 100
knob 8 d4.hold 0
knob 8 d4.decay 30
knob 8 d4.volume 60
knob 8 d4.send2 30
knob 8 level 90
# FX I a dotted-eighth echo, FX II a hall
knob 11 engine delay
knob 11 e1 108
knob 11 e3 56
knob 11 e4 70
knob 12 engine hall
knob 12 e2 74
knob 12 e3 56
mst lo 64
mst hi 66
mst comp 14
mst pump 18
mst pumpby kick
mst release 64
mst level 104
groove swing

